  "title": "Indian Cauliflower",
  "description": "This not only tastes glorious, but it looks glorious as well. The cauliflower is brushed with oil and turmeric before being baked whole in the oven. A curry sauce is whipped up and poured over the golden cauliflower when it emerges from the oven.",
  "authors": [
    "Hetal"
